DG1_CHECK: Same-router forwarding passes the first output token wallet and custom payload to route_dex_messages, which derives pool_idata from the current Router and the payload token wallet. Cross-router forwarding pays the output JettonWallet to Router2; Router2 receives a transfer_notification and re-derives its own Pool. In both paths the Router payout handler requires ctx.at(SENDER) equal the derived Pool address. A mismatched wallet pair yields a different deterministic Pool with no existing reserves; an existing reserve-bearing pair is the intended hop.
